  "observations": [
    "The new room, thumbnail and separate syringe container are visible in both viewport runs. The container sits beside the cabinet and stays attached to the background after movement; its source silhouette remains complete and proportionate.",
    "The wide contained room leaves solid-color side margins on desktop and a solid-color upper band in the tall mobile arena. These areas are visible and accepted as an explicit display limitation, not claimed as full-bleed art.",
    "All three prop images show complete visible silhouettes in both gallery views. The central mask trophy remains distinct from BOZO AWARD, and its black hollows, cyan ornaments, pink nose, stem and round base are visible.",
    "Molly, Mister Butler and Better Than Blitzo Guy remain intentionally partial portraits with explicit Buste wording; no missing full-body base is claimed as delivered.",
    "Molly has a readable MODELE HISTORIQUE 2015 badge and a complete note explaining its pre-series design provenance. The inherited Crymini fiche separately states MODELE HISTORIQUE 2017; the years are not conflated.",
    "All six new fiche titles, archive/accessory roles, dimensions and reference controls are readable in desktop and mobile captures. The twelve opened reference groups show their link texts; exact qualified href values were checked by the automated run.",
    "No accidental crop, stretch, horizontal overflow, broken image or visual overlap obscuring the reviewed new assets was observed in these captures."
  ],
  "scopeClarifications": [
    "The inherited S1/S2 selector filters gallery, roster and costumes. It does not filter S2 arenas; the distinct S3 arena gate remains outside this change.",
    "This is local Chromium desktop and mobile touch emulation, not validation on a physical phone, other browsers, every camera limit or a production deployment.",
    "Contact sheets are review intermediates in scratch. The finalizer preserves the exact original PNG evidence in docs/standalone/production-v11/browser-captures."
